DOMAIN-SUFFIX,epicgames.com      # Epic 游戏联机对战

# 全量远程工具与 P2P 传输 (极其关键：防 QUIC 阻断导致 P2P 打洞失败，被迫降级 TCP 中转)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oray.com             # 向日葵/花生壳
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sunlogin.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,todesk.com           # ToDesk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cybertunnel.run
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,teamviewer.com       # TeamViewer
