DOMAIN-SUFFIX,rustdesk.com         # RustDesk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,parsec.app           # Parsec (强实时串流，绝不可降级 TCP)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,logmein.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,blip.net             # Blip (底层重度依赖 QUIC 协议直传)

